     1,
     "<div><div style=\"color:#000;background-color:#fff;font-family:garamond,new york,times,serif;font-size:14px\"><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Dear ggplotters,</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">For a beginner practising multiple line plotting in R, using the below few data. </span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Included below the data is the desired graph output, created in Microsoft Excel.</span></div><div style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"192\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;word-break:break-word;width:144pt\"><colgroup><col width=\"64\" span=\"3\" style=\"width:48pt\"></colgroup><tbody style=\"width:192px\"><tr height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><td height=\"20\" width=\"64\" style=\"min-height:15pt;width:48pt\">Days</td><td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">Mussel(pH)</td><td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\"> Water(pH)</td></tr><tr height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><td height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\">D4</td><td align=\"right\">6.3</td><td align=\"right\">6.6</td></tr><tr height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><td height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\">D7</td><td align=\"right\">6.73</td><td align=\"right\">7.3</td></tr><tr height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><td height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\">D9</td><td align=\"right\">6.47</td><td align=\"right\">6.94</td></tr><tr height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><td height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\">D11</td><td align=\"right\">6.47</td><td align=\"right\">6.94</td></tr><tr height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\"><td height=\"20\" style=\"min-height:15pt\">D14</td><td align=\"right\">6.7</td><td align=\"right\">6.83</td></tr></tbody></table><br></div><div style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Days (xlab) while pH(ylab).</div><div style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">I expected to have something like below in R.</div><div style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/attach/3d77977442544572/image.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Inline images 1\" width=\"454\" height=\"230\" style=\"border-width:0px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:13px\" dir=\"ltr\">Please advise.</div><div style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:13px\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:13px\" dir=\"ltr\">Aminu</div></div></div>"
